  "deleteID": null,
  "deletedAt": null,
  "deletedBy": null,
  "details": "To prevent people from using uploading clients and other exploits to upload bad and hack avatars, change the avatar checking to server side ONLY after upload is complete. then allow or force remove if needed. But doing a server side ONLY check this can prevent a TON of hack avatars from even begin uploaded.\n\nAlso re-check all current uploaded avatars for any thing that could be hacks or other bad things",
